# Normalize line endings: the repo is LF-only. Prevents core.autocrlf on
# Windows checkouts from turning tracked source into CRLF, which otherwise
# makes `prettier --check` (endOfLine: "lf") fail on a fresh working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
